[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://c8vq8ho7ukxto"]

; Two-zone traffic corridor (PLAN.md I3b/I3c). A straight ~98 m road runs along -Z between two
; WorldZoneMarkers (ZoneA south at z=0, ZoneB north at z=-98). Each zone streams in AI-driven cars on a
; one-way lane (CorridorAB drives north, CorridorBA drives south); a car drives to the far end, DESPAWNs
; (VehicleRoute.end_behavior), and the zone tops the population back up at the lane entry — continuous
; GTA-style traffic. Host-authoritative; clients receive the cars + seated drivers via MSG_VEHICLE_SPAWN
; + occupancy. Instanced once in World.tscn. Carjack any car with Enter (PLAN.md I3c).

